'' 'match' (RFC-0001-match): what needs the subject's type (symbols/semmatch.tiko). TKO1250 not
'' exhaustive -- an enum member, an integer without 'else', a tuple combination; 1251 an arm that
'' cannot run; 1252 'Name( ... )' over another type; 1253 the wrong field count; 1254 a type
'' pattern over a non-pointer; 1255 'starts' over a non-string; 1256 a binding in a value-form
'' match hiding a constant; 1257 a tuple pattern over a non-tuple. 1254, 1255 and 1257 also draw
'' the desugared code's own errors (RFC 'Known limits'); the internal '__tko_pos' name never shows.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/match-types.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(15,1): error TKO1250: 'match' is not exhaustive: green is not handled
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(19,19): error TKO1250: 'match' is not exhaustive: any other value is not handled
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(24,5): warning TKO1251: this 'match' arm can never run
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(26,1): error TKO1250: 'match' is not exhaustive: (FALSE, FALSE) is not handled
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(31,10): error TKO1252: the pattern 'pair( ... )' needs a subject of type 'pair', and it is 'point'
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(35,10): error TKO1253: 'point' has 2 fields, and the pattern names 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(39,5): error TKO1254: a type pattern needs a pointer to a class, and the subject is 'long'
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(43,5): error TKO1255: 'starts' needs a string, and the subject is 'long'
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(47,5): error TKO1257: a tuple pattern needs a tuple, and the subject is 'point'
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(52,5): warning TKO1256: the binding 'limit' hides the constant of the same name
'' EXPECT-OUT: match-types.tiko(53,5): warning TKO1251: this 'match' arm can never run
'' EXPECT-NOT: __tko
